{
 "id": "towns",
 "title": "The open towns",
 "voiced": [],
 "cast": {
  "hm-gatherer": "Moss gatherer",
  "hm-widow": "Widow Sorrel",
  "hm-boy": "Wim",
  "ds-keeper": "Spring keeper",
  "ds-seller": "Water seller",
  "ds-girl": "Nell",
  "mf-herder": "Loftbuck herder",
  "mf-old": "Old Fen",
  "kr-ferry": "Bridge warden",
  "kr-smith": "Smith Garra",
  "kr-mother": "Annick",
  "rb-ropemaker": "Ropemaker Hask",
  "rb-girl": "Wren",
  "rb-lookout": "Lookout",
  "wb-miller": "Miller Bain",
  "wb-fisher": "Eel fisher",
  "wb-child": "Pip",
  "dh-host": "Innkeeper Marl",
  "dh-drover": "Drover",
  "lb-keeper": "Barrow keeper",
  "lb-farmer": "Farmer Tilde",
  "lb-boy": "Ansel"
 },
 "objectives": {},
 "actors": [
  {
   "id": "hm-gatherer",
   "map": "town-highmoss",
   "x": 9,
   "y": 4,
   "look": "vil1",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "hm-gatherer",
     "text": "\"Moss for bedding, moss for wounds. It grows up here because nothing else will.\""
    },
    {
     "say": "hm-gatherer",
     "text": "\"The Commons buys all we can cut now. Kane's surgeons pack it into cuts. Better than the Guild paying us in tins.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "hm-widow",
   "map": "town-highmoss",
   "x": 15,
   "y": 8,
   "look": "vil2",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "hm-widow",
     "text": "\"Larkfold sang on harvest nights. We could hear it from here, over the cloud. It's been quiet a year.\""
    },
    {
     "say": "hm-widow",
     "text": "\"If you're from down there, girl, you're welcome to a bowl. Nobody's asked for a song since.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "hm-boy",
   "map": "town-highmoss",
   "x": 6,
   "y": 9,
   "look": "vil3",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "hm-boy",
     "text": "\"Ma says the grey coats came up the cloud path. There's no cloud path. I've looked.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ds-keeper",
   "map": "town-dripstone",
   "x": 6,
   "y": 7,
   "look": "vil4",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "ds-keeper",
     "text": "\"Every drop in this village has been through the mountain first. Takes forty years, they say.\""
    },
    {
     "say": "ds-keeper",
     "text": "\"The Guild wanted the springs for a hatchery. Brood rooms need warm water. The caves are too cold for them, thank the stone.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ds-seller",
   "map": "town-dripstone",
   "x": 16,
   "y": 8,
   "look": "vil5",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "ds-seller",
     "text": "\"Mineral water. Good for the raw, people say. It isn't. Nothing is. But it's something to hold in your hands.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ds-girl",
   "map": "town-dripstone",
   "x": 12,
   "y": 10,
   "look": "kid2",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "ds-girl",
     "text": "\"There's a cave that sings when the wind's right. Like someone humming under the hill.\""
    },
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "Ash's ears go flat at the cave mouth, then forward again."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "mf-herder",
   "map": "town-mistfold",
   "x": 12,
   "y": 5,
   "look": "vil6",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "mf-herder",
     "text": "\"The mist sits in the fold all summer. The bucks like it. Keeps the flies off and the Wardens lost.\""
    },
    {
     "say": "mf-herder",
     "text": "\"A Warden came through in spring asking for Larkfold folk. We sent him round the fold three times. He went home wet.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "mf-buck",
   "map": "town-mistfold",
   "x": 6,
   "y": 4,
   "look": "loftbuck",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "A big loftbuck, half asleep in the mist. It sniffs Ash, decides he's no trouble, and goes back to sleep."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "mf-old",
   "map": "town-mistfold",
   "x": 8,
   "y": 10,
   "look": "vil7",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "mf-old",
     "text": "\"I wore a lull once, after the fall that did my hip. Six months. I've still got the rings.\""
    },
    {
     "say": "mf-old",
     "text": "\"Took me a whole winter of the raw to come off it. I'd not wish that on a Warden.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "kr-ferry",
   "map": "town-kerrow",
   "x": 12,
   "y": 7,
   "look": "vil1",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "kr-ferry",
     "text": "\"Kerrow's bridge, Kerrow's toll. One copper, or a song, or a good story. Commons go free since spring.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "kr-smith",
   "map": "town-kerrow",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 9,
   "look": "vil4",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "kr-smith",
     "text": "\"I shoe the Guild's cart horses and I shoe the Commons' too. A horse doesn't pick a side.\""
    },
    {
     "say": "kr-smith",
     "text": "\"But I put the Guild's nails in a little crooked. Don't tell anyone.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "kr-mother",
   "map": "town-kerrow",
   "x": 7,
   "y": 3,
   "look": "vil2",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "kr-mother",
     "text": "\"The indenture carts take the gorge road because it's quiet. My eldest went on one, two winters back.\""
    },
    {
     "if": {
      "stage": [
       "a3",
       "a3b",
       "a3c",
       "a4",
       "a5",
       "a6",
       "a6b",
       "a7",
       "a7b",
       "a7c"
      ]
     },
     "then": [
      {
       "say": "kr-mother",
       "text": "\"You're with the Commons now? If you ever stop one of those carts, would you look for a boy called Dell? Freckles. Laughs like a goose.\""
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "rb-ropemaker",
   "map": "town-ropebridge",
   "x": 13,
   "y": 10,
   "look": "vil5",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "rb-ropemaker",
     "text": "\"Every rope in that bridge, I twisted. Walk it slow and don't look down. Down is a long way.\""
    },
    {
     "say": "rb-ropemaker",
     "text": "\"Hask's my name, not the village. The village was further west. I don't talk about it.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "rb-girl",
   "map": "town-ropebridge",
   "x": 9,
   "y": 4,
   "look": "kid",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "rb-girl",
     "text": "\"I can run the bridge in eleven steps. Ma says if she sees me do it again she'll tie me to the post.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "rb-lookout",
   "map": "town-ropebridge",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 3,
   "look": "vil3",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "rb-lookout",
     "text": "\"From here you can see the whole Vale on a clear day. Millbridge, the weir, the Sallow chimneys.\""
    },
    {
     "say": "rb-lookout",
     "text": "\"Those chimneys smoke day and night. My cousin says it's the boilers. Brood rooms have to be hot as summer.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "wb-miller",
   "map": "town-weirbank",
   "x": 6,
   "y": 6,
   "look": "vil4",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "wb-miller",
     "text": "\"The weir turns three wheels. Grain, fulling, and the Guild's saw. Guess which one pays.\""
    },
    {
     "say": "wb-miller",
     "text": "\"I hear Millbridge buried eleven last year. Larkfold greenlings, they said. I don't believe it. I knew Maren.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "wb-fisher",
   "map": "town-weirbank",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 10,
   "look": "vil6",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "wb-fisher",
     "text": "\"Eels come up the weir in autumn. You can stand on the stones and pick them out of the water like apples.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "wb-child",
   "map": "town-weirbank",
   "x": 14,
   "y": 4,
   "look": "kid3",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "wb-child",
     "text": "\"Is that a real kith? Does it bite? Can I touch it? It's looking at me.\""
    },
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "Ash allows one pat, then walks behind Rhea's legs."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "dh-host",
   "map": "town-drovers-halt",
   "x": 6,
   "y": 5,
   "look": "vil7",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "dh-host",
     "text": "\"Drovers' Halt. Last beds before the Drove Road goes up into nothing. The Commons drink here now. They pay, mostly.\""
    },
    {
     "say": "dh-host",
     "text": "\"No rooms tonight, sorry. Every bed's full of Kane's lot sleeping off a march.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "dh-drover",
   "map": "town-drovers-halt",
   "x": 8,
   "y": 8,
   "look": "vil1",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "dh-drover",
     "text": "\"Took forty loftbucks to the Mill Cities in spring. The Guild checkpoint took four of them for 'inspection'. Never saw them again.\""
    },
    {
     "say": "dh-drover",
     "text": "\"South of the Vale it's all checkpoints now. You need papers to sneeze.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "dh-buck",
   "map": "town-drovers-halt",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 4,
   "look": "loftbuck",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "A drove loftbuck in the pen, horns wrapped in rag against the wind. It watches Ash with polite interest."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "dh-cat",
   "map": "town-drovers-halt",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 9,
   "look": "reedcat",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "A reedcat asleep on the hay. It opens one eye at Rhea and closes it again."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "lb-keeper",
   "map": "town-longbarrow",
   "x": 11,
   "y": 6,
   "look": "vil5",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "lb-keeper",
     "text": "\"The long barrow's older than the Guild, older than the Vale's name. Nobody knows who's in it.\""
    },
    {
     "say": "lb-keeper",
     "text": "\"People leave things on it. Rings, mostly. Lull rings, cut off with a knife when somebody finally gets clean.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "lb-farmer",
   "map": "town-longbarrow",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 10,
   "look": "vil2",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "lb-farmer",
     "text": "\"Two of my lads went off to join Kane in the spring. I told them the Commons can't win. They told me nobody ever stopped a Guild cart either.\""
    },
    {
     "if": {
      "stage": [
       "a4",
       "a5",
       "a6",
       "a6b",
       "a7",
       "a7b",
       "a7c"
      ]
     },
     "then": [
      {
       "say": "lb-farmer",
       "text": "\"That cart at Hob's Bend. That was you? With the children? Well. Sit down, then. There's bread.\""
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "lb-boy",
   "map": "town-longbarrow",
   "x": 4,
   "y": 9,
   "look": "kid",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "lb-boy",
     "text": "\"If you lie on the barrow at night you can hear it breathing. Ansel's brother says so. I'm Ansel.\""
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
